              tags: ["Python", "Scikit-learn", "EDA"]
            }, {
              num: "05", tag: "Technical Project", title: "Technical Implementation",
              desc: "Technical paper outlining architecture, solutions, and development phases for a software system.",
              link: "/assets/Final-Paper-incomplete.pdf", linkLabel: "View Final Paper",
              tags: ["Software Architecture", "Documentation"]
            }].map(card => (
